      "whatItDoes": "promptfoo is a command-line tool and library for evaluating and red-teaming LLM-based apps. You define test cases and expected results, run them against prompts and models, and compare the outputs side by side in a viewer. Its red-teaming mode scans apps and agents for vulnerabilities.",
